Required attribution: "Parlomino pictograms (https://clement-avenel.github.io/parlomino/), CC BY-SA 4.0".

Many pictograms are adapted from OpenMoji (https://openmoji.org), the open-source
emoji and icon project, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0: colors were mapped to the
Parlomino palette and outlines thickened. They are listed at https://clement-avenel.github.io/parlomino/credits/ and in packages/library/elements.openmoji.json of the source repository,
with the author and the original symbol of each one. Changes: colors mapped to the
Parlomino palette, outlines thickened, body parts recolored in skin tone. This does
not imply any endorsement by the OpenMoji project. When sharing them, please include
OpenMoji's suggested attribution:
"All emojis designed by OpenMoji – the open-source emoji and icon project.
License: CC BY-SA 4.0" (https://openmoji.org).

Apps using @parlomino/core get the credits of every composed pictogram in the
`credits` field of the result.

The code in this package (src/index.ts, scripts/) is licensed under Apache-2.0,
see the LICENSE file at the root of the repository.
